project planning phase
In the planning phase, the complete development process of FitBuddy was divided into different tasks.
First, the user interface was planned for collecting fitness information.
Next, the backend was planned using Python and FastAPI.
The Gemini API was selected for generating personalized fitness plans and updating plans based on user feedback.
SQLite was selected as the database for storing user details and fitness plans.
SQLAlchemy was planned for connecting the Python application with the database.
The project was also planned with an admin section where stored users and their fitness plans can be viewed.
The development was divided into frontend development, backend development, Gemini AI integration, database development, testing and final demonstration.
